## Prompt

Edit image 1 ONLY INSIDE the existing cloud shapes. Image 1 is the exact fixed layout and silhouette source; image 2 is ONLY internal painting reference.
Keep every cloud bank's position, scale, contour, central opening, gaps and distant outer modules from image 1. Do not adopt image 2's planar layout, do not rearrange or add/delete banks. Retain polar orientation: inward crowns light, outward undersides shaded.
Replace image 1's repetitive tiny scalloped brush dabs and nested round cell shading with image 2's large flat quiet connected grayscale light/midtone/shadow planes. Three or four broad overlapping tonal masses per major bank, long gently irregular shadow boundaries and shallow asymmetrical overlaps, subtle smooth tonal variation within each plane. NO tiny puff dots, beaded/scalloped shadow borders, cauliflower, noisy brush stamps, serrated paint texture or white rims. Do not merely blur image 1: redesign INTERNAL shadow silhouettes as broad coherent hand-painted planes matching reference2. Keep volume suggested through broad overlapping surfaces rather than repeated small balls. Pale gray filled inward light surfaces, mediumgray outward shadows; no pure white overexposure. Preserve all black empty areas exactly and source silhouettes as closely as possible. Opaque black background, grayscale only, square atlas. No text or guides.

## Refinement

Keep the exact layout and cloud outer silhouettes. The interiors still have too many repeated round scalloped boundaries. Simplify INTERNAL SHADING much more: merge 80 percent of internal small puffs into wide quiet connected gray planes. Large left-bottom bank should read as roughly 3 broad interlocking elongated light/shadow zones, not dozens of outlined bubbly cells. Each shadow boundary runs a long calm gently irregular curve with sparse shallow bends, not bead-like bumps. Upper-right bank only two or three broad flat overlapping planes. Keep original inward light/outward shadow direction, no screen-horizontal streaks. Do not blur silhouette, no added strokes, no white rim. Keep black sky and positions exactly. Natural restrained animation-background painted planes; little internal detail.
